            "review_title": "Review at Nha Trang Pub",
            "review_text": "Путешественник\nKhabarovsk, Russia9 contributions\n0\nNha Trang PUB Vietnam, Nha Trang. May 2025\nMay 2025 • Couples\nWe found out about this beer bar by accident, through social media chats. Pub is on the north side of Nha Trang. We came to try a beer. But we didn't expect to get into the kind and cozy atmosphere of this bar. The bar itself is small, but very creative and cozy. If time allowed, we'd be there even longer. Very friendly host, no tension in communication, can give a lot of interesting information about life in Vietnam. The beer is delicious, great. Anyway, we're really glad we found out about this bar and went there. We recommend it!!!👍\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten May 25, 2025",
            "rating": 1.0,
