            "review_title": "Review at Nha Trang Pub",
            "review_text": "Jen_NTVN\nNha Trang, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nGreat Little Place in Village\nAug 2022\nIt's hard to miss this Pub, opposite Muong Thanh Ba Lang hotel - close to the beach only 2 minute walk along. Went here few times in the evening to enjoy Beers and Light Snack( It was very Tasty - i prefer Salted Tuna mostly). They have simple Menu but Good price and Selection! Of course The Owner+Staff are very Welcome. \nDefinitely must-try place when visiting Nha Trang city.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2022",
